    ],
    "summary": "A model waiting to fight on death counts as present until removal. It can use its datasheet abilities and be targeted by Stratagems. Both sides can measure from or to it where applicable and account for it in visibility. Enemies can remain engaged, including for Pile-in and Consolidation restrictions in an Overrun fight.",
